 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_d90a6715e5689e4da6ce",
   "sourceHash": "d90a6715e5689e4da6ced25d8d5b451b6d3629b400f1a5c93ebc955818df3efe",
   "text": "九夜节（Navaratri）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fce0546445fd1e6bbe07",
   "sourceHash": "fce0546445fd1e6bbe07f9395338027bbf45d66ad2638f4e5db220ffb0fbc43c",
   "text": "：在帕拉卡德各寺庙中举行的艺术、文化与灵性的盛大庆典。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_73371f84f4081cb6f107",
   "sourceHash": "73371f84f4081cb6f10784ecb5356850eeb048aba1a7137f2f8c8acf0e571ef4",
   "text": "九夜节（Navaratri）：在帕拉卡德各寺庙中举行的艺术、文化与灵性的盛大庆典。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2157f2918e42350a649f",
   "sourceHash": "2157f2918e42350a649f6b7418662349925cafdbe264c41c2e70532c51aaefdc",
   "text": "通往健康与探索之门",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1b31126f7b3b05f049d9",
   "sourceHash": "1b31126f7b3b05f049d9f07fbb38316b0ea882ac5c33a9c4636800f9ba899312",
   "text": "帕拉卡德将宁静、自然之美与丰富的文化完美融合，无与伦比。在 Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village，您可以在接受世界一流的阿育吠陀疗法和健康调理项目的同时，领略帕拉卡德的精华。无论您寻求放松身心、灵性成长，还是想深入探索喀拉拉邦的瑰宝，帕拉卡德都是理想之地。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'destination' rendered as '理想之地' (neutral place wording) to avoid holiday/tourism framing."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_eb3ffbd63323c1b1d4de",
   "sourceHash": "eb3ffbd63323c1b1d4de330729f221aceb2ceb1cebf16c24099c186a53cde351",
   "text": "立即规划您的帕拉卡德之行",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1d89fea689fc410b5389",
   "sourceHash": "1d89fea689fc410b5389399797d22454ae6393c2efcefef7797a70141f5454c7",
   "text": "喀拉拉邦大象游猎｜野生动物与自然体验",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_98e31fb3dac372794df7",
   "sourceHash": "98e31fb3dac372794df726f768a2682ed9d75b03a5e6d5090c6c62e1fadf594b",
   "text": "在佩里亚尔国家公园（Periyar National Park）参加大象游猎，领略喀拉拉邦荒野之美，观赏雄伟的大象和多样的野生动物在自然栖息地中的身姿。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9ceb99fe6e01732895b2",
   "sourceHash": "9ceb99fe6e01732895b265d2c8b0e93b585f9fa8bee13f87bbc3574679ca7897",
   "text": "发现自然之美与大象的雄姿",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6f76b1e4e82bd722eb27",
   "sourceHash": "6f76b1e4e82bd722eb270f670d9c71bce34e04cce8cebd292eb088f49021274c",
   "text": "对于亲近原始自然之美的人来说，大自然能带来丰富的体验。在众多自然奇观中，大象堪称地球上最壮观的生灵之一。它们的雄伟与温和令人心驰神往，与它们的相遇往往令人难以忘怀。对于渴望在自然栖息地中亲眼观赏这些雄伟动物的人来说，很少有地方能与喀拉拉邦的魅力相媲美。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ca107ed8740a90ed8352",
   "sourceHash": "ca107ed8740a90ed83527a28ae5fcc2916eafe92b85976807044e93e75921bed",
   "text": "大象游猎",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9f98b7c7f071714517d9",
   "sourceHash": "9f98b7c7f071714517d9a5e67c135b41fa3e91f20bac108158b33b073396f6e5",
   "text": "参加",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Fragment: English article 'An' has no Chinese equivalent; rendered as '参加' so that '参加 + 大象游猎 + 是…' reads naturally."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d1a0efe03238c1be8d82",
   "sourceHash": "d1a0efe03238c1be8d82bf39908c0436b4f20d8d84d16c2eb86f09605e6e1a84",
   "text": "大象游猎",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4b39d3035153e024ad9a",
   "sourceHash": "4b39d3035153e024ad9a7e89a74aa9b4a21541d87ce72448601e68c1bbcc2bbe",
   "text": "是亲近自然的一种精彩方式，可以近距离观赏这些温和的巨兽。看着它们嬉戏沐浴、泼水玩耍，是一幅令来访者惊叹不已的美妙景象。喀拉拉邦风光葱郁，拥有众多野生动物保护区，其中包括著名的",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_601c7b6d378eabc8348c",
   "sourceHash": "601c7b6d378eabc8348ce1e8fa3ffa717476fcaedf39faeb455f75f1ff3660f7",
   "text": "佩里亚尔国家公园（Periyar National Park）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fab5ab6075f26afc5477",
   "sourceHash": "fab5ab6075f26afc54778ec770a6c3dd8066dfbc2b7b972aed50be0cf1a98122",
   "text": "，它坐落于西高止山脉的群山之中。这座保护区是大象的栖息天堂，也展现了人与野生动物之间的和谐共存。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9629d20e8288100a7546",
   "sourceHash": "9629d20e8288100a75461167172e09923b6eca27e797f44ff4bcdce914a4483f",
   "text": "参加大象游猎是亲近自然的一种精彩方式，可以近距离观赏这些温和的巨兽。看着它们嬉戏沐浴、泼水玩耍，是一幅令来访者惊叹不已的美妙景象。喀拉拉邦风光葱郁，拥有众多野生动物保护区，其中包括坐落于西高止山脉群山之中的著名的佩里亚尔国家公园（Periyar National Park）。这座保护区是大象的栖息天堂，也展现了人与野生动物之间的和谐共存。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4bca34830ff10a59ccd4",
   "sourceHash": "4bca34830ff10a59ccd48f31d79f08eb1f3cc6c5d8abb2ab0d22571d8dee1eb8",
   "text": "喀拉拉邦原始的荒野在很大程度上仍未受破坏，为探索其多样的生态系统提供了理想的环境。骑象穿越茂密的林地、观赏丰富的野生动物，能让您以独特的视角感受自然世界。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_eb067e6c0e290b8745f2",
   "sourceHash": "eb067e6c0e290b8745f23e6ac56e029aad971d9aa1939a4ddddf1d6b10b439ab",
   "text": "以其拥有百年历史的人工湖和丰富的生物多样性而闻名，它不仅是大象的保护区，也是众多野生动物的栖息地。来访者可能会遇见老虎、豹、豺、赤麂、尼尔吉里叶猴、野猪、印度野牛等动物。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Fragment follows a park name; leading comma dropped so '<name>以其…而闻名' reads naturally in Chinese."
   ]
  }
 ]
}
